  "code_share": "Even on Zen4 the current code needs ~9 wall s per SIM s solo (7.3 without the measurement-only RBPF digest and LLM wait). \"rest\" (Python control/perception/map plus the measurement-only RBPF digest of 87-108 s) is 67-70% of wall; physics 18-21%, capture 11%. The old e2e3 6-7 s on Oracle E6 Zen5 used different code/workload; Zen5 was not measured here (unverified)."
 },
